    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d70-a1">

                <pb facs="0149" n="101" sameAs="frus:frus1877/pg101"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[From the North China Daily News.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Shanghai</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1877-04-20"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 20,
                        1877</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Yesterday the foreign employés on the Shanghai and Woosung Railway commenced the
                    term of their second period of engagement of eighteen months. It was at one time
                    thought uncertain whether at the expiration of their first term of eighteen
                    months, some, or even all of them, would not he sent home. The fact of the
                    second term being commenced without any change, speaks favorably for the
                    permanency of the line, and the probable extension of railway enterprise in
                    China.</p>
            </div>
